{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07669","headline":"蓟北行二首 二 · 李希仲","name":"蓟北行二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一身救边速，烽火通蓟门。\n前军飞鸟断，格鬬尘沙昏。\n寒日鼓声急，单于夜将奔。\n当须徇忠义，身死报国恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李希仲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}